Subject: RAKwireless packet forwarder changes

The packet forwarder reads local_conf.json, sets the system clock from GPS
time once, no longer prints the concentrator temperature and is quieter about
GPS read errors. The image does not use this packet forwarder; the patch keeps
the HAL tree as it has always been built here.

